:KnowledgeDomain rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:label "KnowledgeDomain"@en ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "knowledge of a specific, specialized discipline or field"@en ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "An example of knowledge domain can be Biology or Chemistry"@en .


###  https://purl.org/ontology/modalia#LL1Remember
:LL1Remember rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf :LearningLevel .


