:LearningGoalMatrixEntry rdf:type owl:Class ;
                         rdfs:label "LearningGoalMatrixEntry"@en .


###  https://purl.org/ontology/modalia#LearningLevel
:LearningLevel rdf:type owl:Class ;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The level of learning, is defined as six levels; strting from Knowledge and ending by Synthesis"@en .


